+      "type": "text",
+      "x": 60,
+      "y": 405,
+      "width": 800,
+      "height": 24,
+      "text": "【CSS Grid 同一セル重ね合わせ（Overlay）構造図】",
+      "fontSize": 16,
+      "fontFamily": 1,
+      "textAlign": "left",
+      "verticalAlign": "top"
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "box_wrap",
+      "type": "rectangle",
+      "x": 80,
+      "y": 445,
+      "width": 760,
+      "height": 180,
+      "strokeColor": "#1c7ed6",
+      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
+      "fillStyle": "solid",
+      "strokeWidth": 1,
+      "roughness": 0
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "label_wrap",
+      "type": "text",
+      "x": 95,
+      "y": 455,
+      "width": 730,
+      "height": 20,
+      "text": ".diff-line-editor-wrap (display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr; width: 100%; height: auto)",
+      "fontSize": 12,
+      "fontFamily": 1,
+      "textAlign": "left",
+      "verticalAlign": "top"
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "box_layer_highlight",
+      "type": "rectangle",
+      "x": 100,
+      "y": 485,
+      "width": 350,
+      "height": 120,
+      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
+      "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
+      "fillStyle": "solid",
+      "strokeWidth": 1,
+      "roughness": 0
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "text_layer_highlight",
+      "type": "text",
+      "x": 115,
+      "y": 495,
+      "width": 320,
+      "height": 100,
+      "text": "背面: .diff-line-highlight (grid-area: 1/1/2/2)\n・通常フロー要素（position: static）\n・長いテキストの折り返し時に高さを自然拡張！\n・空行や末尾改行も \\u200B で高さを確実維持\n・mark.changed のみ鮮明緑/赤の背景を描画",
+      "fontSize": 11,
+      "fontFamily": 1,
+      "textAlign": "left",
+      "verticalAlign": "top"
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "box_layer_editor",
+      "type": "rectangle",
+      "x": 480,
+      "y": 485,
+      "width": 340,
+      "height": 120,
+      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
+      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
+      "fillStyle": "solid",
+      "strokeWidth": 1,
+      "roughness": 0
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "text_layer_editor",
+      "type": "text",
+      "x": 495,
+      "y": 495,
+      "width": 310,
+      "height": 100,
+      "text": "前面: <textarea>.diff-line-editor (grid-area: 1/1/2/2)\n・z-index: 1 / background: transparent\n・height: 100% でハイライトの高さにピタリ追従\n・テキスト色: #000000（純黒文字）\n・キャレット: #000000（黒カーソル）で編集可能",
+      "fontSize": 11,
+      "fontFamily": 1,
+      "textAlign": "left",
+      "verticalAlign": "top"
+    }
+  ]
+}
